msgid ""
"All `mdc_gid_to_*`, `mdc_layer_to_*` and `get_mdc_gid` are backed by "
"compiled NumPy ufuncs. The calling convention is identical for scalar, "
"NumPy array, and Awkward Array inputs:"
msgstr ""
"`mdc_gid_to_*`、`mdc_layer_to_*` 与 `get_mdc_gid` 都由编译好的 NumPy ufunc "
"实现。标量、NumPy 数组与 Awkward Array 三种输入的调用方式完全一致："

