#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:78 db70c078eddc4bd79d18fba234da1d14
msgid ""
"`mdc_gid_to_stereo` returns the stereo type of the wire, which can be `0`"
" (axial), `-1` for `west_phi < east_phi` and `1` for `west_phi > "
"east_phi`."
msgstr ""
"`mdc_gid_to_stereo` 返回丝的 stereo 类型：`0` 表示 axial，`-1` 表示 `west_phi < "
"east_phi`，`1` 表示 `west_phi > east_phi`。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:81 e0d231be05934fd69c6689d071b5a4b4
msgid "Use `parse_mdc_gid` to parse all fields from a gid at once:"
msgstr "用 `parse_mdc_gid` 一次性解析 gid 的所有字段："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:110 bfc46bcde90f4faa834fc0414ffbacb3
msgid ""
"When the input is an `ak.Array`, the result is also an `ak.Array` with "
"record fields."
msgstr "当输入为 `ak.Array` 时，结果也是带 record 字段的 `ak.Array`。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:112 6cf003e229554583aff09b93d4163598
