msgstr "丝的位置"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:114 f02a5a6d7c5745bd84afb9eea41f0472
msgid ""
"All `mdc_gid_to_west_*`, `mdc_gid_to_east_*`, `mdc_gid_z_to_*` are also "
"backed by compiled NumPy ufuncs."
msgstr ""
"`mdc_gid_to_west_*`、`mdc_gid_to_east_*` 与 `mdc_gid_z_to_*` 同样由编译好的 NumPy "
"ufunc 实现。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:175 f0737f5c435746fda8bcbd89968d0754
msgid ""
"Get the x, y coordinates of a wire at a specific z position. "
"`mdc_gid_z_to_x` / `mdc_gid_z_to_y` take two arguments (`gid` and `z`), "
"both support scalar/array inputs independently:"
msgstr ""
"获取某条丝在给定 z 处的 x、y 坐标。`mdc_gid_z_to_x` / `mdc_gid_z_to_y` 接受两个参数（`gid` 与 "
"`z`），两者都独立支持标量/数组输入："

