#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:247 a7ec3490908e428484f725d873d5f072
msgid ""
"The ADC and the TDC channel numbers of a hit can be converted into charge"
" and time with `mdc_adc_to_charge` and `mdc_tdc_to_time`:"
msgstr "hit 的 ADC 与 TDC 道数可用 `mdc_adc_to_charge` 与 `mdc_tdc_to_time` 分别转换为电荷与时间："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:260 25bd0c4b02f64a3bba4fb30a2c3e0edd
msgid "The conversion formula of the time is:"
msgstr "时间的换算公式为："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:262 f06f8f9e108b4b5c8c0e68a1d459dd89
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\text{time} = \\text{tdc} \\times 0.09375~\\mathrm{ns}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\text{time} = \\text{tdc} \\times 0.09375~\\mathrm{ns}\n"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:267 3462f825300a4c57ba485b9d735087d9
msgid ""
"In BOSS there is no concrete physics unit of the MDC charge: the raw "
"channel number is used in the reconstruction, hence `mdc_adc_to_charge` "
"only casts the ADC to `float64`."
msgstr ""
"BOSS 中 MDC 的电荷没有具体的物理单位：重建时直接使用原始道数，因此 `mdc_adc_to_charge` 只是把 ADC 转成 "
"`float64`。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:270 7c60e66808c64c10956bac729c071ffb
msgid "Same as BOSS"
msgstr "与 BOSS 一致"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mdc.md:273 c2a58037db024ae2a7158c26eb3014bd
msgid ""
"MDC charge and time calculations are the same as the ones given by "
"`RawDataUtil::MdcCharge` and `RawDataUtil::MdcTime` in `BOSS`."
msgstr ""
"MDC 的电荷与时间计算与 `BOSS` 中 `RawDataUtil::MdcCharge` 和 `RawDataUtil::MdcTime` "
"给出的结果一致。"

